---
import NotebookPage from './NotebookPage.astro';
import styles from './Hero.module.css';
---
<NotebookPage id="hero" reveal={false}>
  <div class={styles.topline}><span>FIELD NOTES / PARTH SINHA</span><span>always a work in progress ↗</span></div>
  <div class={styles.spread}>
    <div class={styles.copy}>
      <p class={styles.hello}>oh, hello. I'm</p>
      <h1 class={styles.name}>Parth<span aria-hidden="true">.</span></h1>
      <p class={styles.eyebrow}>independent systems researcher</p>
      <p class={styles.tagline}>I get curious about<br />what happens <span class={styles.underneath}>underneath.</span></p>
      <p class={styles.lede}>Storage engines, lock-free queues, cache lines, and the awkward bits around I/O. The parts you tend to notice when something goes wrong.</p>
      <div class={styles.ctaRow}><a href="#projects" class={styles.primary}>look through my projects <span>↗</span></a><a href="#contact">say hello ↗</a></div>
      <p class={styles.afterthought}>C++ / Go / a lot of crossed-out ideas</p>
    </div>
    <aside class={styles.margin} aria-label="Notebook margin">
      <div class={styles.annotation}>inside my head, more or less ↓</div>
      <div class={styles.loop}>
        <span>read a paper</span><b>↘</b><span>have an idea</span><b>↓</b><span><s>it works!</s> measure it</span><b>↙</b><span>try again ↺</span>
      </div>
      <div class={styles.mascot}><img src="/illustrations/notebook-chip.webp" width="600" height="600" alt="A blue pen doodle of a little chip holding a pencil on a stack of notebooks" /><p>small chip.<br />many questions.</p></div>
      <p class={styles.sidenote}>Most days: reading papers,<br />writing code, staring at a profiler.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <div class={styles.bottomline}><span>↓ follow the loose threads</span><span>01 / the introduction</span></div>
</NotebookPage>
